// IntroString :
"P4198582776" "I'm worried about the Tsoo, {HeroName}. My sources tell me those power hungry gangsters have some big plan in the works, but nobody seems to know anything specific. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you should hit the streets of Talos Island and take down as many Tsoo as you can.</A> Maybe one of them will give us a clue about their next move. When you're done clearing Talos, move on to Independence Port."
